  cookingInstructions:
  - Chop the Pork Belly into slice
  - Chop the Chili into slice
  - Chop the Garlic into slice
  - Turn the on the stove to high heat
  - Put the Pan in the Stove
  - Add the Pork Belly
  - 'Add Water '
  - Put the pan lid and boil
  - stir using spatula
  - Add 1 tbsp of cooking oil
  - Add the chop garlic
  - Saute using the spatula
  - Add the chop chili
  - Add 1/2 tbsp of peppercorn
  - 'Add pork blood '
  - Add 1/8  tsp of salt
  - Add 1/2 cup of vinegar
  - Mix it using Spatula
  - Put the Pan Lid to simmer
